#usda 1.0
(
    defaultPrim = "Robotiq_2F_85"
    doc = """Newton (MuJoCo-Warp) parallel-grip physics for the Robotiq 2F-85.

Thin overlay on the shared Newton four-bar (./Robotiq_2F_85_newton_fourbar_physics.usda:
loop_closure spherical equalities, inner_finger pad springs, right_outer_knuckle NewtonMimic,
finger_joint drive, Mjc tuning) over the shared Newton-pure
bodies/colliders (./Robotiq_2F_85_newton_common_physics.usda) and the neutral joint frames
(./Robotiq_2F_85_kinematics_physics.usda).

This variant's ONLY delta is removing the four-bar's distal coupler DOF so the linkage is
forced PARALLEL instead of encompassing:
  * left/right_outer_finger_joint are SUPPRESSED (active=false), and
  * outer_finger is rigidly WELDED to outer_knuckle (FixedJoint, shared with the PhysX
    parallel grip in ./Robotiq_2F_85_parallel_weld_physics.usda).

outer_finger stays in the articulation (the inner_finger pad joint hangs off it); locking its DOF constrains the four-bar to parallel motion. This closed-loop
formulation is rigid (no oscillation), unlike an open tree coupled by independent mimic
constraints. VERIFIED live in Isaac+Newton (standalone and full UR5e teleop): drives 0..0.80
rad and back, settling with zero joint velocity (rigid) at every commanded position.

RV.011: shared Newton+MuJoCo tuning (same as newton_compliant, from the fourbar layer) --
the mjc:* params tune the MuJoCo-Warp (Newton) solver; no Physx* runtime data here."""
    metersPerUnit = 1
    subLayers = [
        @./Robotiq_2F_85_newton_fourbar_physics.usda@,
        @./Robotiq_2F_85_newton_common_physics.usda@,
        @./Robotiq_2F_85_collision_physics.usda@,
        @./Robotiq_2F_85_parallel_weld_physics.usda@,
        @./Robotiq_2F_85_body_mass_physics.usda@,
        # fingertip_physics only authors values nothing else overrides, so its slot is arbitrary.
        @./Robotiq_2F_85_fingertip_physics.usda@,
        @./Robotiq_2F_85_kinematics_physics.usda@,
        @./base.usda@
    ]
    upAxis = "Z"
)

over "Robotiq_2F_85"
{
    over "Robotiq_2F_85"
    {
        over "Joints"
        {
            # Parallel: distal coupler DOF removed (outer_finger welded rigid in
            # ./Robotiq_2F_85_parallel_weld_physics.usda). The
            # live four-bar revolutes live in the compliant variant; the shared fourbar
            # layer leaves outer_finger_joint untouched so each variant decides its fate.
            over "left_outer_finger_joint" (active = false) {}
            over "right_outer_finger_joint" (active = false) {}
        }
    }
}
